      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CDC to update the respective shards of Inverted Indexes, Document Store and Trie\nDebezium connector scanning logs to replicate the data into Search Engine using Kafka\nSearch Engine can retry using the Kafka message replay in case of failures",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Gnzf1qi7TZEbhAWXOuXDv",
      "originalText": "CDC to update the respective shards of Inverted Indexes, Document Store and Trie\nDebezium connector scanning logs to replicate the data into Search Engine using Kafka\nSearch Engine can retry using the Kafka message replay in case of failures",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
