      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791273595587,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lag of ~200ms can be considerable in replicating the Trie, Inverted Indexes and Documents.\nMore than that needs proper alerting in order to close it as soon as appears.",
