      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lag of ~200ms can be considerable in replicating the Trie, Inverted Indexes and Documents.\nMore than that needs proper alerting in order to close it as soon as appears.",
